{"speciesId":441,"names":{"fr":"Pijako","es":"Chatot","en":"Chatot","ja":"ペラップ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It keeps rhythm by flicking its tail feathers like a metronome. It imitates human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it’s one of them. This way they won’t attack it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it’s one of them. This way they won’t attack it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa langue comparable à celle de l’homme lui permet d’imiter habilement le langage humain."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa langue comparable à celle de l’homme lui permet d’imiter habilement le langage humain."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il reproduit le cri de ses ennemis pour faire croire qu’il est des leurs et éviter d’être attaqué."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Imita los sonidos de sus rivales, haciéndoles creer que son amigos e impidiendo que le ataquen."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it’s on